  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sustainable Bioenergy Assessment (BEFS) and Capacity Building in Seychelles</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To support MEECC to analyze and identify potential bioenergy feedstock and technologies that can be developed in Seychelles for sustainable bioenergy production using stand-alone power system (SAPS) intended to rural electrification an medium/large scale combined heat and power (CHP) systems. 
To provide capacity building on the use of the BEFS tools to key stakeholders involved in the bioenergy sector and in the formulation of a biomass energy strategy so as to support the development of a sustainable bioenergy sector in the country.</narrative>
  </description>
